# The Supabase project behind the Commons (ADR-0001). Copy to .env.local and
# fill in from the linked project's dashboard (Settings → API). Both values
# are public by design — the anon key ships with the browser, and Row Level
# Security is the authorization boundary. Without them the app runs with
# sign-in unavailable and browsing unaffected. Never put the service_role key
# here: it bypasses RLS and must stay server-side.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
